RESOLUTION NO. 2025-01 OF THE LIMITED PARTNERSHIP

WHEREAS the declaration of limited partnership has been executed by all partners;

IT IS RESOLVED THAT:
1. Subscriptions are accepted and capital contributions declared by each limited partner are acknowledged as received;
2. The registered office is established at [address], Province of Quebec, where books and records will be kept;
3. [General Partner Name] is appointed general partner and chief operating officer;
4. [Officer Name] and [Officer Name] are appointed officers, with authority to open bank accounts, execute leases, obtain permits and file statutory registrations;
5. Officers must obtain all food-safety, environmental, fire safety and municipal licenses required to operate the grocery business.

This resolution is effective immediately.
